<section class="section-anchor" id="transport">
  <div class="section-eyebrow">★ Moving through the city</div>
  <div class="section-heading">Transportation</div>
  <div class="section-sub">Bike lanes, parking, OTIS. What's on your block and where to go when something's wrong with it.</div>
  <div class="gilt-rule"></div>

  <div class="trans-card">
    <div class="trans-grid">
      <div class="trans-tile">
        <div class="trans-tile-icon">🅿</div>
        <div class="trans-tile-title">Parking on your block</div>
        <div class="trans-tile-body">Permit zones near <%= @address %> · how to apply for resident parking · visitor passes · where to dispute a ticket.</div>
        <div class="trans-tile-meta">By address · Zone varies</div>
      </div>
      <div class="trans-tile">
        <div class="trans-tile-icon">🚲</div>
        <div class="trans-tile-title">Bike lanes near you</div>
        <div class="trans-tile-body">Protected, painted, and unprotected lanes within 0.5 mi. Indego dock locations. How to request a lane on your street.</div>
        <div class="trans-tile-meta">Indego · Philly Bike Map</div>
      </div>
      <a href="https://www.phila.gov/departments/office-of-transportation-and-infrastructure-systems/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="trans-tile">
        <div class="trans-tile-icon">🏛</div>
        <div class="trans-tile-title">OTIS · Office of Transportation</div>
        <div class="trans-tile-body">What OTIS does, where it sits in city government, and how to reach it. Long-range bike, pedestrian, and complete-streets planning.</div>
        <div class="trans-tile-meta">
          <%= address_link("1401 JFK Blvd, Philadelphia, PA 19102", display_text: "1401 JFK Blvd · Floor 11") %>
        </div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
